#: search2:search2_17E59A1E_C2AD_472F_A3C9_CA533D23C576
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6af540e6658dc4dde5039b2f8693bb3bee21fd34750f26247db0f396c2c037e
#. default-sha256: 2c5700277d1c37c30dae0c278a82669e4d3da8e08f1d70b66b69eaba0046b7ae
msgctxt "search2:search2_17E59A1E_C2AD_472F_A3C9_CA533D23C576"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The words of one foolish woman determined the course of my entire life. ⟪k:2⟫Before I "
"was even born, my fate was decided.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Did her claim come from faith? Was it her way "
"of escaping reality? Did she do it for money? Or fame? I don’t know."
msgstr ""
"　한 어리석은 여자의 발언이 제 모든 인생을 결정지었어요. ⟪k:0⟫네―― 저는 태어나기 전부터 운명이 정"
"해졌죠.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　그 발언이 여자의 신앙에서 비롯된 것인지, 현실도피인지, 돈 때문인지, 허세였는지"
"―― 저는 모르겠어요."

#: search2:search2_1089FD7A_2480_4B50_930C_A13BD08F918B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d85af65f9eb966e96f3f3c15dec36087bf6f04f380ef1a6da6554f3c8b55aba1
#. default-sha256: 3a9d7f012317543409a6c5d06a23d72ac2d6b300c15d1091f752b131c116e1dd
msgctxt "search2:search2_1089FD7A_2480_4B50_930C_A13BD08F918B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The village where she lived had suffered from years of poor harvest. ⟪k:2⟫It had been "
"months since the last rain, and all the villagers prayed desperately to be blessed with succor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　그 마을은 긴 흉작에 시달렸어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　땡볕이 지속되어 몇 달이나 비가 내리지 않는 상황 "
"속―― 누구나 절망하며, 하늘에 한 방울 은총을 빌었죠."

#: search2:search2_92D9C1B4_DF69_4220_8D5A_EBEDCA4D3909
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1af756a3603425b16953e069fd5cee9f56aff4efa61b2bf2eea4b061dc691204
#. default-sha256: 36b9ce4bc46b960874c838344ce654adaae3c90255dd8d3aadab5739da18a368
msgctxt "search2:search2_92D9C1B4_DF69_4220_8D5A_EBEDCA4D3909"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I am with child, though I have known no man!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「저는 남자와 관계를 맺지 않고 아이를 잉태하였습니다!」"

#: search2:search2_D097AA71_4A38_41C0_91E3_5AE8CB17787F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5af97480fb0c246624b7bed4a3ab90f72afc670f6302f6e15f33357271cf866a
#. default-sha256: 4f3dde5d0674f37c10d6cb4993d2e91d847c2fcab287b90aa3ad9d2166542112
msgctxt "search2:search2_D097AA71_4A38_41C0_91E3_5AE8CB17787F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So proclaimed the pregnant woman in the midst of the drought.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And on the "
"day of my birth, the very moment I let out my first cry,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫a heavy rain fell down upon the "
"village.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫The storm quenched the parched earth, nourishing the crops and saving the "
"village. ⟪k:10⟫The villagers were astounded, for they had thought the drought would never end."
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫As plump drops of rain poured down upon the village, they gathered around "
"newborn me in exultation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　그럴 때, 임신한 여자가 그런 말을 했어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　그리고 제가 이 세상에 태어난 순간"
"――⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　마을에 단비가 내렸죠.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　비는 모든 갈증을 축이고, 작물을 살려 내어 마을 사람"
"들을 구원했어요. ⟪k:7⟫영원할 것 같던 가뭄의 갑작스러운 끝은 모든 이들을 놀라게 했죠.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　비"
"가 내리는 마을에서―― 사람들은 갓난아기인 저를 축복했어요."

#: search2:search2_97488FB8_DEDE_4B47_9455_21D6335BF989
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4849c5810f3f8044a386402e70d23ae946976bf7c6a445073543dded9914699e
#. default-sha256: 757d011ded032adac6d6eae745136234e23b1399785e4eb08087025e31e43537
msgctxt "search2:search2_97488FB8_DEDE_4B47_9455_21D6335BF989"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perhaps there would be more wonder in claiming I had magical powers. ⟪k:2⟫Perhaps it "
"would make a better story if I were to say there were higher forces involved. ⟪k:3⟫But all these "
"years later, here is what I truly think:⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫It was nothing more than a fluke. "
"⟪k:8⟫An improbable stroke of luck.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫An unbelievably fortunate accident for my mother and "
"the village—⟪k:11⟫and an indescribably unfortunate accident for myself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　……제게 기적의 힘이 있었다고 하는 게 그럴싸할까요. ⟪k:1⟫불가사의한 현상이라 설명하는 게 이야"
"기로서 낫긴 하겠네요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　하지만 시간이 지난 지금, 제 생각은 이래요.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　그건 "
"우연에 불과했어요. ⟪k:7⟫확률 문제에 불과했어요.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　사람들과 어머니에게는 몹시 운 좋은 우연"
"이었으며――, 저에게는 몹시 불행한 우연이었죠."

#: search2:search2_C8331C9D_43DB_4A92_B3F6_F0917106E78F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea10800504a86df5af5745cc408554b3d391a15069c641a4a68d60b019715b89
#. default-sha256: 7a6b17944e048a70d2a54f59e621d2c4cdc3891766ed788331fee70587c3b5a1
msgctxt "search2:search2_C8331C9D_43DB_4A92_B3F6_F0917106E78F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Michel... the time when I lived and the time when you lived were not so different. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Our views and beliefs about the world are very much the same, ⟪k:3⟫so you should understand that "
"in our time, blood was seen as unclean. ⟪k:4⟫It was a dreadful thing, ridden with diseases, which "
"is why we drained the blood from animals and purified the flesh before consuming it.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫But being a saint, my blood would have been different. ⟪k:8⟫Like the blood of the saints who "
"came before me, mine would be blessed.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I believed it would be able to cleanse people’s "
"impurities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　미셸……, ⟪k:1⟫당신이 살던 시대와 제가 살던 시대는 큰 차이가 없어요. ⟪k:2⟫당신의 상식과 제 상"
"식은 거의 일치하는 수준이죠. ⟪k:3⟫그러니 당신이라면 알 거예요.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　우리 시대에서 피는 부정"
"한 것으로 인식되었어요. ⟪k:6⟫불길한 것이며, 병마를 품은 것으로 여겨졌어요. ⟪k:7⟫그래서 우리는 동물"
"의 피를 제거하여 정화한 거죠.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　하지만 성녀인 제 피는 다를 거예요. ⟪k:10⟫옛 성자의 피가 "
"그랬듯이 제 피도 은총이 될 테죠. ⟪k:11⟫제 피라면 사람들을 부정한 것들에게서 정화할 수 있으리라―― "
"그리 판단했어요."

#: search2:search2_4293C089_1C85_48B3_A4BD_6329F82D9EC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99cd5df5f290a108fca230564a2d71cba64b9c720e67a5ed8e1ed45c367dce57
#. default-sha256: 6f22b71bbc33bf0ca7c2bdf47fee628d5df06f09430f91dd0ee09babf8ebe7b3
msgctxt "search2:search2_4293C089_1C85_48B3_A4BD_6329F82D9EC6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But if you would give me a chance, I would like to explain myself. ⟪k:2⟫I was but a "
"young girl at the time. ⟪k:3⟫And to a child, her mother is the world. ⟪k:4⟫Anything she says is "
"the absolute truth.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫So when my mother’s claims so happened to coincide with a lucky "
"miracle, my young mind was set in stone.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I was a saint.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫My "
"blood could heal the sick.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫And nothing would convince me otherwise.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫After all, I was but a girl of six years old."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　하지만 변명이나마 하게 해 주세요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　저는 그때 어린아이였어요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　어린아이"
"에게는 어머니의 말이 전부예요. ⟪k:5⟫그게 세계의 모든 것이죠.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　그래서 어머니의 말을 믿고"
"――, 우연히 기적과 조우한 시점에서, 어린 저의 인식은 완전히 굳었죠.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　나는 성녀다."
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　내 피는 사람을 치유한다.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　이를 의심하지조차 못 했어요.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"⟪k:17⟫　그 당시에…… 저는 불과 여섯 살짜리 소녀였거든요."

#: search2:search2_74DF6E1C_9F3F_4A02_88FC_8F0F637CAEDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a9e4522ee92b5fd9586d81025ab27f459ebfa1f1012cbefaebb549ec0a1f6f3
#. default-sha256: 19028c016bd4351c189f3402b5d47862571e166e8ef0d000629e550580e533c4
msgctxt "search2:search2_74DF6E1C_9F3F_4A02_88FC_8F0F637CAEDB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It didn’t take long for word of the miracle-performing child of God to spread. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Travelers from faraway lands came to our village, all in search of aid.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Driven by a "
"mixture of elation and duty, I gave my blessings unto every pilgrim who sought them. ⟪k:6⟫I gave "
"them my blood, yes.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫My young hands were perpetually covered in wounds. ⟪k:11⟫"
"Running out of skin on my fingers, I cut the back of my hands, my palms, my wrists. ⟪k:12⟫Before "
"long, they had turned into swollen, carved-up, black-and-red horrors, ⟪k:13⟫and so I kept them "
"wrapped in cloth at all times. ⟪k:14⟫The only time I uncovered them was to give blood to those "
"who sought it.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫My lacerated hands were, in no uncertain terms, gruesome and "
"unsightly, ⟪k:18⟫but the believers who came to see me all wept at my “selfless sacrifice.”⟪k:19⟫"
"⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫And so I came to cherish those wounds."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　제 마을에 성녀가 있다는 소문은 삽시간에 퍼졌어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　기적을 바라는 자는 멀리서도 찾"
"아오기 시작했죠.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　저는 일종의 흥분과 사명감에 충동질되어, 찾아온 모든 이들에게 기적을 베"
"풀었어요. ⟪k:5⟫네, 맞아요―― 제 피를 주었어요.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　어린 제 손가락은 늘 상처투성이였어"
"요. ⟪k:9⟫다섯 손가락으로도 부족해져서 손바닥, 손등, 손목까지 그었어요. ⟪k:10⟫피부가 파여 항상 검붉"
"은 살이 엿보이는―― 비참한 상태였죠.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　저는 평상시에 천을 말아 손을 가렸어요. "
"⟪k:14⟫누군가가 기적을 청하러 올 때만 그 천을 풀었죠. ⟪k:15⟫제 상처투성이 손은 보기만 해도 징그럽"
"고 끔찍했을 거예요. ⟪k:16⟫하지만 신앙자들은 그 상처를 보고 「존귀한 희생의 증거」라며 눈물을 흘렸"
"어요.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫　……그 말을 들은 저는 제 상처가 사랑스럽기 그지없었어요."

#: search2:search2_B6BD1699_7737_4379_B796_F6F4888EB0FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75c99d1d6582db89f18c2f03a7a4c90ff74135daa56cfe533d0cffdbfbc1bdd5
#. default-sha256: f07319692f54b7a1c8ff0769cfc8889764ac10c8c1dc2d064507411797f1ecf0
msgctxt "search2:search2_B6BD1699_7737_4379_B796_F6F4888EB0FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But the next day, ⟪k:2⟫I was sold off.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Men I had never seen before "
"carried me by the arms and tossed me into a carriage. ⟪k:6⟫Confused and panicked, I stuck my head "
"out, searching for my mother.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Off in the shadow of the house, ⟪k:10⟫I saw her with "
"a strange man—⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫accepting a bag of coins."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　하지만 그 다음 날――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　저는 팔렸어요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　누군지도 모를 남자가 제 팔을 잡고 "
"마차 안으로 끌고 갔죠.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　영문도 모른 채 마차에서 고개를 내밀어 어머니를 찾았어요.⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫　그 순간, 저는 보았어요.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　그늘 속에서――⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　낯선 남자에게서 돈이 "
"든 주머니를 받는 어머니를."

#: search2:search2_E6FB4A24_7FE8_4101_A9C9_F5A1C933E065
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b8096fedbf6fef0b955ca189d9a85c804b8ce5320bcaced8e2289def8a2a2a0
#. default-sha256: cb93830aa99916d5881b79d1c01acfc1e7d79471dabf77631ba4517363a06d70
msgctxt "search2:search2_E6FB4A24_7FE8_4101_A9C9_F5A1C933E065"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The carriage rocked back and forth, back and forth as it rolled along a dirt road. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Shaking and bouncing within it, I struggled with overwhelming grief and despair. ⟪k:3⟫It was, "
"perhaps, the first time in my life I had felt such a powerful emotion.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I didn’t "
"know ⟪k:7⟫what⟪k:8⟫ I felt so much despair over, though. ⟪k:9⟫Obviously, it was over my present "
"predicament, but I wasn’t sure what about it hurt the most.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Was it that I "
"had been pawned off like a slave? ⟪k:14⟫Was it that my mother—the mother of a saint—had been "
"blinded by money? ⟪k:15⟫Was it that the villagers had watched in silence as a disciple of the "
"Lord was thrown into a carriage?⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Or was it that I, daughter of God, ⟪k:20⟫"
"lamented my misfortune like a mortal?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　포장도 안 된 도로를 달리는 마차는 좌우로 크게 흔들렸어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　저는 그 진동 속에서 비"
"탄과 절망에 잠겼어요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　그건 제가 태어나서 처음으로 품은 강한 감정이었을 거예요.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫　저는 무엇에 절망하는 건지 몰랐어요. ⟪k:7⟫물론 이 상황에 절망하긴 했는데――, 명확하게 할 수"
"가 없었어요.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　성녀인 제가 속세 사람들처럼 팔린 사실에? ⟪k:11⟫성녀의 어머니란 입장"
"이면서 돈에 눈이 먼 어머니에게? ⟪k:12⟫성녀가 눈앞에서 팔리는데 거스르지도 않던 마을 사람들에게?"
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　혹은――⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫　주님의 아이인 제가 다른 사람들처럼 슬퍼하는 사실에?"

#: search2:search2_FF2F5CD2_17B0_44F3_8CA1_E7DA2DDDB0FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1aa25d730a1bcaee2ed093bd16c1e72a9ccce4ea52dc5d2ade816d6076323146
#. default-sha256: ca87c32a347a762479f7bb13ad08160c1111a93805710590a797b93682a5b43e
msgctxt "search2:search2_FF2F5CD2_17B0_44F3_8CA1_E7DA2DDDB0FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The third week, the carriage arrived at a city. ⟪k:1⟫It was much larger than the village I "
"had grown up in, with many, many more people crowding the streets. ⟪k:2⟫Something about them ⟪k:3⟫"
"felt⟪k:4⟫ different too.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫They all spoke in a tongue foreign to me, ⟪k:8⟫which is "
"when I realized I was far, far away from home."
msgstr ""
"　이윽고 마차는 한 도시에 도착했어요. ⟪k:0⟫제가 태어난 마을보다 크며, 사람들이 많이 오가는 곳이었"
"죠. ⟪k:1⟫사람들이 자아내는 분위기도 제가 알던 것과 달랐어요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　귀에 들리는 언어도 익숙지 "
"않아서――⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　저는 제가 머나먼 곳까지 왔단 걸 깨달았어요."

#: search2:search2_DC4CD8EC_3727_4CDB_B254_F3D9D4B750B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fcf62d74d00162c675513a7b61bd8ec23cffa69a682bc5c611d543dc1bb037b6
#. default-sha256: a899c6b05757c61318b1de2ad2714fae010d2cc3aea9eff9ee31453def656a19
msgctxt "search2:search2_DC4CD8EC_3727_4CDB_B254_F3D9D4B750B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was delivered to the lavishly decorated mansion of the region’s lord. ⟪k:2⟫Brightly "
"colored flowers bloomed wildly in the garden as guests laughed and ate extravagant meals.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫And in addition to them, there were probably four times as many slaves moving about the "
"grounds.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Getting a range of looks from everyone we passed—from smartly dressed men "
"to scrawny, emaciated servants—I was led to the lord’s chambers.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The lord "
"was surrounded by beautiful women. ⟪k:13⟫Perhaps they were slaves, or perhaps they were "
"prostitutes—I couldn’t tell. ⟪k:14⟫Among them were some girls hardly older than me. ⟪k:15⟫They "
"all wore thin swathes of cloth, barely covering themselves at all.⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫The "
"lord looked me up and down, and with a laugh, he said,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　제가 끌려간 곳은 그 땅을 다스리는 영주의 저택이었어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　매우 호화로운 저택이던 "
"게 기억나요. ⟪k:3⟫정원에는 형형색색 꽃이 만발했고, 내빈객들은 호사스러운 요리를 먹으면서 웃었으며"
"――⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　그 내빈객들의 네 배나 되는 노예가 돌아다녔죠.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　화사한 옷을 입은 자들, 야"
"윈 자들의 온갖 시선을 받으며―― 저는 영주의 방으로 끌려갔어요.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　영주 주위에는 아름"
"다운 여자가 있었어요. ⟪k:11⟫노예일 수도 있고, 창녀일 수도 있겠네요. ⟪k:12⟫그 안에는 어린 소녀도 있"
"었어요. ⟪k:13⟫얇은 천만 몸에 두른 모습은 사실상 알몸에 가까웠죠.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　그런 상황에서 "
"영주는 저를 찬찬히 뜯어보더니, 웃으며 말했어요."

#: search2:search2_C36F63C9_F725_4400_A3C1_2F80C9ED50DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bad61380857aba6ccc1395f4bee604363293bbb47ec71c69cad4ea1f107bb116
#. default-sha256: 04cc3a8112df12e6a1c53e2c9b5738e4119e50ce8c8c21685f9f1c5609daac5c
msgctxt "search2:search2_C36F63C9_F725_4400_A3C1_2F80C9ED50DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So the lord forced his will upon me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He bound my hands and feet and cut me "
"without my permission, filling a goblet with my blood and passing it around to his guests."
msgstr ""
"　영주는 강압적인 수단을 취했어요.⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　제 사지를 묶어 꼼짝도 못 하게 한 후, 제 허가 없이 살"
"갗을 그어 피를 빼앗은 거죠. ⟪k:2⟫그리고 제 피를 잔에 부어 내빈객들에게 음료로 대접했어요."

#: search2:search2_77C89967_DD3E_4BBB_BCE1_E8B26CF824F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45579856cc0a0e8e11a04b729f01b4434a75832db3e5cb0c9df68e0f0da2cc72
#. default-sha256: 123fce166513435711560043a9be0efc465ce940cc35d6397ef9667b3ce616d0
msgctxt "search2:search2_77C89967_DD3E_4BBB_BCE1_E8B26CF824F5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Every time he threw a banquet, he drained me of my blood.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It became nearly "
"impossible to find a spot on either of my arms that ⟪k:4⟫wasn’t⟪k:5⟫ a swollen, reddish-black "
"gash. ⟪k:6⟫And soon, because my arms weren’t providing enough blood for him, the cutting spread "
"to my legs.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I lived in a haze of half-consciousness. ⟪k:11⟫Honestly, I’m "
"amazed it didn’t kill me, though perhaps the lord was simply taking care not to take more than my "
"body could spare.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Watching the wealthy partygoers laugh and sip my blood "
"through bleary eyes, another wave of despair came over me. ⟪k:16⟫My miracles—my blood—were not "
"meant to be an appetizer at a feast. They were meant for the sick and the poor.⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫"
"But despite my wishes, the lord persisted to squeeze me dry day in and day out for his own "
"enjoyment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　저는 연회 때마다 피를 뽑혔어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　제 양팔은 상처가 없는 부분이 없을 만큼 검붉어졌"
"고――, 팔만으로는 부족해졌는지 다리에도 똑같이 상처를 입혔어요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　제 의식은 항상 몽롱했어"
"요. ⟪k:5⟫저도 이러고 안 죽은 게 신기할 지경이었어요. ⟪k:6⟫어쩌면 영주는 제 한계를 가늠하면서 피를 "
"뽑던 걸 수도 있겠네요.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　애매모호한 시야 속에서 부유한 자들이 제 피를 마시며 웃었어"
"요. ⟪k:10⟫저는 그걸 보고 또 절망감을 품었어요. ⟪k:11⟫내 기적은…… 내 피는 이런 자들에게 주어질 게 "
"아닌데……, 병든 이, 빈곤한 이에게 주어져야 하는 것인데.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　하지만 그 바람은 이루어지지 않"
"았어요.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　저는 매일같이 영주의 욕망과 쾌락을 위해서만 피를 뽑혔죠."

#: search2:search2_265BA5DF_1814_4DFB_94E0_36DEC30575C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5266e4a48415862bc009b313aef8139663db8af67bf7a178e68fb29bc680ad8
#. default-sha256: ba9ab14e5e9c17d5d8e75261abdf39769b243806d176f6ae193918ab80d63c4e
msgctxt "search2:search2_265BA5DF_1814_4DFB_94E0_36DEC30575C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Suddenly, I found myself released from my bonds. ⟪k:1⟫But my body had grown so weak from "
"being tied up for so long, I didn’t have the strength to hold myself up—and so I collapsed to the "
"floor.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I was still trying to figure out what was happening when the lord drew "
"a sword, raising it high above his head. ⟪k:6⟫His words in that moment reached me with perfect "
"clarity:"
msgstr ""
"　갑자기 제 구속이 풀렸어요. ⟪k:0⟫하지만 오랜 기간 구속되어 쇠약해진 제 몸은 제구실을 못 하고 제자"
"리에 쓰러졌죠.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　저는 상황 파악도 안 되었고――⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　영주는 검 한 자루를 뽑았어"
"요.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　이어서 검을 제 머리 위에서 치켜들었죠.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　그때 외친 말만큼은―― 제 귀에 똑똑"
"히 닿았어요."

#: search2:search2_836438AF_6ED4_4876_982D_86366DA1A3A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e74df5f2f38e79758279271e1c49d211bcb57c142bd463644addb4b96c1fe1f3
#. default-sha256: 2a67e6ffe91895ea91777c22ab49d7fc0132ccbb9265a372dd8ed19348ffd1b8
msgctxt "search2:search2_836438AF_6ED4_4876_982D_86366DA1A3A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A witch?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Why was he calling me a witch?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I was the holy "
"daughter of God; ⟪k:8⟫I had certainly never made a pact with the Devil.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫What "
"could have given him that idea? What was in store for me now? Had God performed some kind of "
"miracle for him? ⟪k:12⟫Dozens of thoughts and questions floated through my mind as death hung "
"over me.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫I couldn’t comprehend anything, and so I didn’t feel any fear or "
"anger at my impending death. ⟪k:17⟫I was simply curious:⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫What had happened to me?"
"⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫But before I had a chance to find that answer—⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫the lord "
"swung down his blade."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　마녀.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　제가 어째서 마녀란 걸까요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　저는 성녀이자 주님의 아이. ⟪k:5⟫악마"
"에게 몸을 바친 적은 없어요.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　무슨 착각인지――, 이번엔 무슨 컨셉의 연회인지――, 주님께서 무"
"슨 기적을 보이시기라도 한 건지――, 죽음을 코앞에 둔 제 뇌리에 여러 생각이 스쳐 지나갔어요.⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　저는 아무것도 몰랐어요. ⟪k:11⟫그래서 그때는 죽음의 공포고 분노고 아무것도 없었어요. "
"⟪k:12⟫오직 의문만이 들었죠.⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　대체 내 몸에 무슨 일이 일어난 것인가.⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　하지"
"만 이를 이해할 새도 없이――⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫　영주가 검을 휘둘렀어요."

#: search2:search2_E9D2BF9F_A6F9_4B5D_8A29_428A3E90DD8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8cbe4101c5f45ab3f39e7baa64b6a2341aa846e263f88b958f74c593faa89ea
#. default-sha256: a0e84ce5388f6f0571eeaf1259b5cf2ec1297d33e35ea8e9c44ffc74298c31d5
msgctxt "search2:search2_E9D2BF9F_A6F9_4B5D_8A29_428A3E90DD8C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And a second later, I crash into the stairs—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫hard."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 몸은―― ⟪k:1⟫가차없이 ⟪k:2⟫계단에 내동댕이쳐졌다."

#: search2:search2_6BBA3247_1FE2_43F2_BD40_2E8E72D56D82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e0ca349e8d68cbdf7a104fd125d4fffbc6c3c3ae293e0a8643ed0408a0e9c77
#. default-sha256: 7d8581e5448922c49c5c6a3780c78a51e6dba06b2c8977830cb017584f1b7553
msgctxt "search2:search2_6BBA3247_1FE2_43F2_BD40_2E8E72D56D82"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Nrg... ⟪k:5⟫gh— ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫aaaagh!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……으, ⟪k:5⟫악――, ⟪k:6⟫으아악……!!"

#: search2:search2_E9BEEBF6_D236_48D0_801B_DED88D71E325
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 071934d38171d4fe0b982919050d3b976befda7d483516ca803f23f93eb59201
#. default-sha256: d7163d1f2234393799601a3eecf2286cc51369c231aa175ba27019ed6c032dba
msgctxt "search2:search2_E9BEEBF6_D236_48D0_801B_DED88D71E325"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Right at my ear, I can hear the ⟪k:1⟫hssssssss, ⟪k:2⟫hssssssss...⟪k:3⟫ of the river of blood."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫귀에서 ⟪k:1⟫주르륵, ⟪k:2⟫주르륵, ⟪k:3⟫피의 강이 흐르는 소리가 ⟪k:4⟫들렸다."

#: search2:search2_7E1D18C0_6B90_41C9_B6FF_5E7C893C0839
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d2d31834f6d4775c8b432daf1d7897dd3ec752e0fda58a270f982a3ee5f3271
#. default-sha256: d887005c4ea436980ac9ebdf78c4554633c342be27c5097913bb04d63032a322
msgctxt "search2:search2_7E1D18C0_6B90_41C9_B6FF_5E7C893C0839"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can practically feel the fire in the eyes of that mad blood banquet’s guests..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫피의 향연―― 아니, ⟪k:3⟫광연을 즐기던 자들의 열기가……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫바로 지금 ⟪k:6⟫눈앞"
"에 있는 것처럼……."

#: search2:search2_70102EEA_5A74_487F_B948_C84B1E8C3C84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e6f505ca655f5d854e49361ad1c2850b6dd33e33545f5816b2a0c27bf679c32
#. default-sha256: 2c81f86caec94a2f24aab393c4ecac6c85d601f227ef4ac904caadeb201b21d5
msgctxt "search2:search2_70102EEA_5A74_487F_B948_C84B1E8C3C84"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My vision distorts. I can’t regain my focus."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫시야가 일그러져 ⟪k:2⟫초점이 잡히지 않았다."

#: search2:search2_04789EE4_0318_4743_8DEA_36118CF6A471
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10473800e4b54b514274ac0b0e07538a783063d73834c4fc8d9f270290064595
