#: search2:search2_2508DEB6_0794_4D62_80BA_0D3A3B727400
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a93faf46dea9876ef8323835febceebf63af36c4a70e00da97e042872e6b970
