msgctxt "search2:search2_2508DEB6_0794_4D62_80BA_0D3A3B727400"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After all, I was a ⟪k:1⟫saint⟪k:2⟫, and saints were supposed to retain their purity. ⟪k:3⟫"
"Spreading my legs for any man who gave me enough coins would shatter my very identity.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫As all that was going through my mind, I probably shouted “No!” in protest, ⟪k:7⟫because the "
"slave gave me an exasperated look and told me he hadn’t brought me here to become a prostitute."
msgstr ""
"　　저는 성녀여야 하잖아요. ⟪k:0⟫순결을 유지해야만 하잖아요. ⟪k:1⟫창녀가 되어 남자에게 몸을 파는 "
"신세가 되면, 제 성녀라는 존재의의가 산산조각이 날 거 아니에요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　저는 아마도 싫다고 외쳤"
"을 거예요.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　하지만 그런 저를 보고, 노예 청년은 조금 기가 찬 눈치였어요.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　"
"――청년은 저를 창녀로 굴릴 생각이 없었거든요."

#: search2:search2_372CD282_492D_4E94_A14F_1CF2576D8010
