#: search2:search2_882D7805_A53B_4B83_B0E8_DEB128D83AD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2aca1a391fe2c8c956be2d8e8341e386969b8d66171832246b218c66dc3b4228
