msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫As the bell’s last pealing faded into silence, the tower door "
"swung open. ⟪k:7⟫Standing on the other side of it were the three men. ⟪k:8⟫They must have wanted "
"to drain a little more from me to use in the feast, ⟪k:9⟫but they arrived at the worst possible "
"moment.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The flaxen-haired young man was the first to express his consternation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　종소리가 그치고……, 조용해진 때.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　감시탑 문이 열렸어요."
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　거기에 나타난 건 세 남자들.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　제게 축제 음식을 주려 했는지――⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　"
"최악의 순간에 딱 맞춰 나타났죠.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　맨 먼저 허둥댄 게 아마빛 머리칼 청년이었어요."

